s=\"lg:hidden text-white flex flex-col gap-1.5 p-2\"><span class=\"block w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"block w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"block w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span></button></div></div></nav><section class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative pt-[40%] md:pt-[20%] xl:pt-[14%] 2xl:pt-[10%] pb-12 min-h-[55vh] sm:min-h-[50vh] md:min-h-[60vh] lg:min-h-[50vh] xl:min-h-[70vh] 2xl:min-h-[60vh] bg-cover bg-center\" style=\"background-image:url(/images/rn-infotech-69.webp)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"w-full relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 md:gap-5 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-24 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-white max-[380px]:text-xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-10 leading-14 lg:leading-22 xl:leading-16 2xl:leading-22\">Supercharge Your Laptop&#x27;s Performance</h1><p class=\"text-white/90 max-[380px]:mt-[-8px] mt-[-8px] max-[380px]:mb-4 mb-4 text-base font-sans font-medium md:text-lg lg:text-xl 2xl:text-2xl w-full sm:w-4/5 text-center\">Is your laptop feeling slow and sluggish? A RAM or storage upgrade could be all it needs. Fast, affordable and done by expert technicians in Mumbai.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 w-[70%] sm:w-auto\"><button class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] w-[240px] cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px] hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><img alt=\"Call icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Call Us Now</button><a href=\"tel:+91 88797 32594\" class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] w-[214px] font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px]  min-h-[50px] sm:hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><img alt=\"Call icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Call Us Now</a><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] border border-light-blue cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-secondary hover:bg-[#00234c] text-light-blue rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Book Home Service</button></a></div></div></section><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-4 md:py-5 border-b border-gray-200 px-4\"><a class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><img alt=\"Arrow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><a class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><img alt=\"Arrow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-primary font-medium\">Ram &amp; Storage Upgrade</span></div><section class=\"bg-white p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row false items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">What We Do</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Give Your Old Laptop a New Life</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">You don&#x27;t always need to buy a new laptop when your old one starts slowing down. In most cases, a simple RAM or storage upgrade can make a world of difference — faster boot times, smoother multitasking and better overall performance.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">At RN Infotech, our expert technicians assess your laptop and recommend the best compatible RAM and storage options to suit your usage and budget. We source quality parts and handle the installation — so you get maximum performance without the hassle.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-77.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-section-bg p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">What&#x27;s Included</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Upgrade Services We Offer</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">RAM Upgrade: </span>Boost your laptop&#x27;s speed and multitasking ability with a compatible RAM upgrade. We recommend and install the best option for your device and budget.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">HDD to SSD Upgrade: </span>Switch from a slow hard drive to a lightning-fast SSD. Experience dramatically faster boot times, app loading and overall performance.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Storage Expansion: </span>Running out of storage space? We help you expand your laptop&#x27;s storage capacity with quality hard drives and SSDs.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Data Migration: </span>Upgrading your storage? We safely migrate all your existing data to the new drive — no data loss, no hassle.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-71.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row false items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Benefits of Upgrading</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Why Upgrade Your RAM &amp; Storage?</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Faster Performance: </span>A RAM upgrade means faster multitasking, smoother browsing and quicker app loading — a noticeably snappier experience.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Lightning Fast Boot Times: </span>Upgrading to an SSD can reduce your boot time from minutes to seconds. Your laptop will feel brand new.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Cost Effective: </span>An upgrade costs a fraction of buying a new laptop — and delivers a dramatically improved experience.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Better Efficiency: </span>SSDs consume less power than traditional hard drives, resulting in better battery life and less heat generation.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-68.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 max-[380px]:px-5 p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16 2xl:px-50\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center\"><p class=\"label font-semibold\">? FAQs</p><h2 class=\"italic max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-11 leading-14\">RAM &amp; Storage Upgrade — Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full items-start\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">How do I know if my laptop needs a RAM upgrade?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">If your laptop feels slow, freezes frequently, or struggles with multitasking — a RAM upgrade is likely to help. Visit our store and our technician will assess your device and recommend the best upgrade.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">What is the difference between HDD and SSD?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">An HDD (Hard Disk Drive) is a traditional storage drive that uses spinning disks — it is slower but more affordable. An SSD (Solid State Drive) has no moving parts — it is significantly faster, more durable and energy efficient.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Will upgrading RAM or storage delete my data?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">No, upgrading your RAM will not affect your data at all. For storage upgrades, we offer data migration services to safely transfer all your existing data to the new drive.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">How long does a RAM or storage upgrade take?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Most upgrades are completed within the same day or a few hours depending on the device and the type of upgrade required.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">How do I know which RAM or SSD is compatible with my laptop?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Don&#x27;t worry — our expert technicians will assess your laptop and recommend the best compatible options for your specific model and usage requirements.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Is an SSD upgrade worth it?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Absolutely! An SSD upgrade is one of the most impactful upgrades you can make to an older laptop. Faster boot times, quicker app loading and improved overall performance — all at an affordable cost.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[480px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"FAQ Image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-36.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center w-full sm:w-auto\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"py-1 cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Still Have Questions? Contact Us</button></a></div></div></secti